# Shared LocalGO dispatch backend (Supabase). Copy this file to `.env.local`
# (which is gitignored) and fill in the values from your Supabase project:
# Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
#
# These point at the SAME Supabase project the driver dashboard
# (localgo-driver-web) uses, so a placed order lands on the driver feed live.
# Only the anon key is used, and only to INSERT an order row — consumer auth
# stays local on-device. Leaving these blank simply disables the dispatch
# bridge; the app still works fully offline.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
